
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="om">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Ifa Daandii Guddinaa College - Odeeffannoo barnootaa fi galmee barattootaa.">
  <title>Ifa Daandii Guddinaa College</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #183047;
      background: #f4f7fb;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    header {
      background: #073b66;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 27px; }
    header p { margin-bottom: 0; }
    nav {
      background: #075985;
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #075985, #138b83);
      color: white;
      padding: 55px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero h2 { font-size: 32px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #facc15;
      color: #17324a;
      padding: 11px 20px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    section { padding: 30px 16px; max-width: 1050px; margin: auto; }
    section h2 { text-align: center; color: #075985; }
    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 9px #00000012;
    }
    .card h3 { color: #087e78; }
    .notice {
      background: #e0f2fe;
      border-left: 5px solid #0284c7;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 5px;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      background: #073b66;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px 12px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header h1 { font-size: 22px; }
      .hero h2 { font-size: 26px; }
      nav a { display: inline-block; margin: 5px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Ifa Daandii Guddinaa College</h1>
    <p>Barnoota Qulqullina Qabuun Gara Fuuldura Ifaatti!</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Mana</a>
    <a href="#about">Waa'ee Keenya</a>
    <a href="#programs">Barnoota</a>
    <a href="#admission">Galmee</a>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <div class="hero" id="home">
      <h2>Baga Gara Kolleejjii Keenya Dhuftan!</h2>
      <p>Beekumsa, Ogummaa fi Carraa Hojii Gara Fuulduraatti.</p>
      <a class="button" href="#programs">Gosa Barnootaa Ilaali</a>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
      <h2>Waa'ee Kolleejjii Keenya</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          Ifa Daandii Guddinaa College keessatti barattoonni
          beekumsa fi ogummaa hojii irratti isaan gargaaru
          akka argatan ni hawwina.
        </p>
        <p>
          Odeeffannoo seensa barnootaa, ulaagaalee fi tajaajila
          kolleejjii yeroo mirkanaa'an as irratti ni maxxansina.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="programs">
      <h2>Gosa Barnootaa</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Nursing</h3>
          <p>Barnoota ogummaa kunuunsa fayyaa.</p>
          <p>Sadarkaa: III–IV</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Pharmacy</h3>
          <p>Barnoota ogummaa qorichaa.</p>
          <p>Sadarkaa: III–IV</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Medical Laboratory</h3>
          <p>Barnoota qorannoo laaboraatorii fayyaa.</p>
          <p>Sadarkaa: III–IV</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Animal Health</h3>
          <p>Barnoota fayyaa beelladootaa.</p>
          <p>Sadarkaa: I–IV</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Crop Production</h3>
          <p>Barnoota oomisha midhaanii.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Animal Production</h3>
          <p>Barnoota oomisha beelladootaa.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Marketing and Sales Management</h3>
          <p>Barnoota bulchiinsa gabaa fi gurgurtaa.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="notice">
        Hubachiisa: Gosti barnootaa, sadarkaan fi hayyamni
        barnootaa waajjira kolleejjii irraa mirkanaa'uu qabu.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="admission">
      <h2>Galmee Barattootaa</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          Galmee barattootaa online jalqabuuf ulaagaalee,
          yeroo galmee fi odeeffannoo quunnamtii kolleejjii
          mirkanaa'e argachuun barbaachisaa dha.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Hubachiisa:</strong> Fuulli kun yeroo ammaa
          unka galmee odeeffannoo kuusu hin qabu. Unka galmee
          dhugaa fi kuusaan odeeffannoo yeroo itti aanu ni dabalama.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Ifa Daandii Guddinaa College</p>
    <p>Barnoota har'aa, abdii borii!</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
